 drivers/clk/sunxi-ng/Makefile              |   2 +
 drivers/clk/sunxi-ng/ccu-sun60i-a733-vo1.c | 126 +++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 138 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/clk/sunxi-ng/ccu-sun60i-a733-vo1.c

